        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 9125, 2-1/2\" Full Lip Extended Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2 inch extended lip strike plate is for use with any manufacturer's tubular entry locks, passage sets, and privacy sets. It is especially handy for custom thick door installations. The full lip extended strike plate has a 2-1/2 inch lip and a 3 inch overall length with a 2-1/4 inch width. It comes packaged with mounting hardware. Choose from 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in other sizes:  <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-lip-strike-plate-don-jo-9115\">1-1/2 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-3-4-inch-lip-strike-plate-don-jo-9175\">1-3/4 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/2-inch-lip-strike-plate-don-jo-9102\">2 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>, \r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/3-inch-strike-plate-don-jo-9103\">3 Inch Lip Strike Plate</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe satin stainless steel, matte black and the dark bronze finishes have a stainless steel base metal. The polished brass, antique brass and satin nickel finishes have a brass base metal.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 9125 Extended Full Lip Door Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lip Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
