                "title": "2-1/2 Inch Lip Strike Plate, Don-Jo 9125",
                "description": "The 2-1/2 inch extended lip strike plate is for use with any manufacturer's tubular entry locks, passage sets, and privacy sets. It is especially handy for custom installations. The full lip extended strike plate has a 2-1/2 inch lip and a 3 inch overall length with a 2-1/4 inch width. It comes packaged with mounting hardware. Choose from 6 finishes.",
